# the same reason data/ is here.
docs/COVERAGE.md

# Lighthouse reports: machine-generated by scripts/lighthouse.mjs, one JSON
# object per line, the same reason data/ is here. Prettier would reformat 16
# files nobody reads by hand and quadruple the diff on every re-measurement.
docs/lighthouse/
